SUMMARY:Digital Photography: Studio Photography
DESCRIPTION:In this follow-up class to Digital Photography Basics\, we will explore more advanced photography techniques including how to shoot inside a studio setting. Users will get hands-on experience with different lighting setups and camera settings. \nAttending Digital Photography I: The Basics (April 4) is recommended\, but not necessary. \nRegistration opens 2 weeks prior to class. Camera equipment will be provided for this class. Participants are also welcome to bring their own camera. \nRegistration opens April 3 at 9:00 am. Register online at https://tpl.ca/locations/DA/\, in person at the front desk\, or by calling the branch at 416-393-7783.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/digital-photography-studio-photography/
LOCATION:Danforth Coxwell Library\, 1675 Danforth Avenue\, Toronto\, M4C 5P2
ORGANIZER;CN="Danforth Coxwell Branch%2C Toronto Public Library":MAILTO:dastaff@tpl.ca
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
