CREATED:20260410T204346Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260413T010950Z
UID:48992-1776439800-1776450600@beachmetro.com
SUMMARY:Spring Fabric Fundraiser with East End Arts
DESCRIPTION:Mark your calendars\, because you’re invited to our second annual Spring Fabric Fundraiser\, just in time for the warmer spring weather! \nCome and join your local east Toronto community arts organization for a fun spring-themed fundraiser! This event is family-friendly and is open to all ages. Please join us on Friday April 17th\, drop-in style from 3:30-6:30PM. There will be lots of fabrics and textiles to browse through and purchase\, plus light refreshments and lemonade to drink! \nThis fundraiser is perfect for textile artists of all backgrounds and skill levels. We’re talking quilters\, darners\, costume enthusiasts\, dabblers\, crafters\, and all our east end neighbours! The warm summer season is just around the corner\, so this is the perfect opportunity to pick up some materials to make your own spring/summer outfits\, or get some textiles of fabrics for those projects you’ve been sitting on all winter. We hope to see you there! \nPRICING INFORMATION:\nBring your own shopping bag and fill it up with fabrics for $20; there will be tables of fabrics ranging from $2 to $20; and we will also be selling many rolls of fabric for $5 per yard. Lots of great deals to be had\, as these are all mostly brand new fabrics! \nFull webpage here: www.eastendarts.ca/spring-fundraiser-2026 See less
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/spring-fabric-fundraiser-with-east-end-arts/
LOCATION:St. Matthew’s Clubhouse\, 450 Broadview Avenue\, Toronto\, M4K 2N3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/10164350/Fabric-Fundraiser-IG.png
ORGANIZER;CN="East End Arts":MAILTO:info@eastendarts.ca
END:VEVENT
