SUMMARY:Once Upon a Spring Night
DESCRIPTION:An interactive evening of poetry and music presented by Beaches author and composer Mark Battenberg\, featuring a live reading and symposium of his transcending poetic work A leaf in the Wind\, with musical meditations by special guest\, Shakuhachi Flute Master Debbie Danbrook. You could win a copy of the book A Leaf in the Wind signed by the author. $20 at the door or pay what you can.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/once-upon-a-spring-night-2/
LOCATION:Danforth Mennonite Church\, 2174 Danforth Ave.\, Toronto
END:VEVENT
