SUMMARY:Young People's Concert and Instrument Petting Zoo
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a joyful mini concert presented by excellent musicians from the Toronto Symphony Youth Orchestra. Right after each concert young people are encouraged to try out instruments – in this concert Clarinets and Cellos. Great fun for the whole family and music lovers of all ages! Any donations are welcome.
URL:https://beachmetro.com/event/young-peoples-concert-and-instrument-petting-zoo/
LOCATION:Kingston Road United Church\, 975 Kingston Rd
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://d28bcn7yu97icd.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/07115549/Image31.jpg
